<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">Overview</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Lead-to-Loyalty Management</h2>
        <p>
            Pindah CRM provides the structural foundation for your entire sales and marketing operation.
            From the moment an enquiry arrives via WhatsApp or a web form, the system ensures it is
            qualified and assigned correctly. Lead scoring models identify high-priority prospects,
            allowing your sales team to focus on deals most likely to close.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            The transition from lead to opportunity is seamless, maintaining a complete history of engagement.
            Marketing automation tools nurture leads with personalized drip sequences, ensuring your brand
            remains top-of-mind until the prospect is ready to purchase.
        </p>
    </div>
